    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d250">

                <pb facs="0244" n="232" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg232"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/523: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-04T12:00:00+03:25">May 4,
                            1942—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received May 4—11:32 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>141. Both Shah and Prime Minister have requested me to express to Department
                    their hope that the arrival of the American advisers requested will not be long
                    delayed. They now wish to have three additional advisers for finance and
                    aviation and an army engineer. I suggested that they make formal request for
                    these advisers to the Department through the Iranian Minister in Washington and
                    the Prime Minister stated he would do so.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
